@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api

### 1. GET all books -- expect 200 and 14 books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### 2. GET one book by id -- expect 200 and a single book object
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### 3. GET a book that does not exist -- expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/99

### 4. A route that does not exist -- expect 404 Route not found
GET http://localhost:3001/anything
